# Copy this file to scripts/forbidden.local (git-ignored) and list, one per
# line, every token that must never appear in this repository:
#   - the employer or organisation the work came from
#   - the event, venue or programme name
#   - personal names, handles, e-mail fragments
#   - headline numbers published elsewhere that would join this repository to
#     that publication (written as plain numbers; matched as whole words)
# Plain lines are matched case-insensitively as fixed strings.
# Lines that are only digits and dots are matched as whole words.
#
# example-employer-name
# example-event-name
# example-person-name
# 0.1234
